--- 
Title: Garlic Parmesan Green Beans
Tags: Sidekicks
---

Set oven to 425F.

Mix in a #large bowl:
- @Olive Oil{2 Tablespoon}
- minced @Garlic{2 teaspoons}
- beaten @Eggs
- @Garlic Salt{1/2 teaspoon}

Toss @Green Beans{12 oz} into the bowl mixture.

Place the mixture onto #baking sheet{}.

Top with @Parmesan Cheese{1/3 cup}.